The enchanted mirror is the prize of the film made by the [[Org/Bisney and Dixar/Arcane Intelligence|arcane intelligence]]. The demigod Maui stole it and hid it in the [[Geography/Elephant Graveyard of Wonders|Elephant Graveyard of Wonders]], and the film's world would fall into darkness if it were not recovered. [[People/Jaskar|Jaskar]] kept it until [[People/Runway Brian|Runway Brian]] and the others took it from him. Its surface is wavy and translucent, like a film of water, and it is the way out of the film: a person who steps through it comes into the real world.
